Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.56,0:15:01.19,IN_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}不断前进的光芒
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.80,0:15:16.92,IN_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}风儿向着明天猛烈地吹着
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.92,0:15:22.12,IN_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}感觉自己要被抛在原地
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.40,0:15:27.77,IN_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}你抹去了我脸上的泪水
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.77,0:15:37.62,IN_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}指尖的热量留在了心间 心动的魔法
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.57,0:16:08.25,IN_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}如果一如既往地欢笑
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.25,0:16:14.66,IN_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}就能够像那朵花一样绽放 我的梦
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.95,0:16:22.87,IN_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}爱和勇气充满了我的心
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.87,0:16:27.67,IN_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}因为你陪伴在我身边
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.67,0:16:36.24,IN_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}我会昂首向前的 光辉无限扩张
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.24,0:16:43.09,IN_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}前进吧 光芒
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED「LOVE or HATE?」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.07,0:22:28.67,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}たとえば髪をちょっとなびかせたら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.67,0:22:31.91,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}聴こえる声{\fsp4}は{\fsp0}LOVE or HATE？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.91,0:22:35.98,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}お好きにどうぞ　何と言われても
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.98,0:22:38.92,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}足は止めませんから
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.29,0:22:42.70,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}飛ぶ鳥落とす勢い　ニュース
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.70,0:22:45.42,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}明日には忘れている
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.18,0:22:49.39,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}昨日よりも今日がいいよね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.39,0:22:52.35,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}思い込み　大勝利
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:22:55.89,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}リズムに合わせて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.89,0:22:59.48,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}揺れていたいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.48,0:23:02.90,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}外野がうるさい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.90,0:23:06.19,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}ノイズ・キャンセリング
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.19,0:23:09.66,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}たとえば指をちょっとなぞらせたら
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.66,0:23:12.82,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}君のチョイス{\fsp4}は{\fsp0}LOVE or HATE？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.12,0:23:16.92,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}お好きにどうぞ　頬を赤くして
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.92,0:23:19.90,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}唾を吐きかけ{\fsp4}る{\fsp0}Boy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.90,0:23:23.50,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}趣味の違い　安心の相違が
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.50,0:23:26.66,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}君を戸惑わせても
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.66,0:23:29.89,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}私の道　形作るのは
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.89,0:23:33.54,ED_JP_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}これだけ　Just LOVE or HATE
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.07,0:22:28.67,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}要是撩一下头发
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.67,0:22:31.91,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}听到的会是喜欢还是讨厌？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.91,0:22:35.98,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}随便吧 无论别人怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.98,0:22:38.92,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}反正不会停下脚步
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.29,0:22:42.70,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}新闻的传播势不可挡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.70,0:22:45.42,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}到了明天就忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.18,0:22:49.39,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}所以今天比昨天好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.39,0:22:52.35,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}精神胜利大法好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:22:55.89,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}本想跟着节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.89,0:22:59.48,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}摇摆摇摆
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.48,0:23:02.90,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}但外面也太吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.90,0:23:06.19,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}噪音·消除
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.19,0:23:09.66,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}要是用手指转个圈圈
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.66,0:23:12.82,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}你的选择是喜欢还是讨厌？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.12,0:23:16.92,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}随便吧 憋红了脸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.92,0:23:19.90,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}准备唾弃的男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.90,0:23:23.50,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}兴趣的不同 信仰的不一
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.50,0:23:26.66,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}让你感到迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.66,0:23:29.89,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}但决定我前行方向的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.89,0:23:33.54,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}仅仅是喜欢还是讨厌
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
